
;AiIdleNoBoot 1.1
;Stops the Active Idle bringing itself to the foreground at boot (E72).
;Target: aiidleint.dll, CAiUiIdleIntegrationImpl::HandleSystemEvent.
;NOP the two `blx r2` (90 47 -> C0 46) that call self->[0x2c]->vtbl[0x24](arg).
;Patterns extended by 2 trailing bytes so each matches exactly once.
;Reversible: RomPatcher+ shadow-patches RAM; remove this .rmp and reboot to revert.
;
	SnR:sys\bin\aiidleint.dll:E06A01684A6A01219047E06B:E06A01684A6A0121C046E06B
	SnR:sys\bin\aiidleint.dll:E06A01684A6A002190474D49:E06A01684A6A0021C0464D49
